  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Integrated Border Management in Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this action is to provide support to the consolidation of integrated border management in the Republic of Georgia, while fully taking into account human rights and integrating a gender perspective. The specific objectives of this action are to improve detection of illegal activities occurring at borders; more effective response to illegal activities occurring at the borders; strengthen capability of the Coast Guard in Search and Rescue and Blue Border security operations; enhance accountability and integrity of border agencies and respect of the rule of law, human rights and gender; and enhance capacities of Border Police and Patrol Police to train their staff in operational, technical and rights-based considerations related to their work.</narrative>
  </description>
